is a Ph.D. candidate in the Department of Electrical, Computer, and Systems Engineering at Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute, Troy, NY, USA. His research focuses on efficient memory system design for Large Language Models. He received the B.E. degree in Microelectronics and Science and Engineering from Southern University of Science and Technology, China.</span>
</span></td></tr>
</table>
