is currently pursuing the Ph.D. degree in the Department of Electrical, Computer, and Systems Engineering at Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute, Troy, NY, USA. His research interest is in computational CXL memory. He received the B.S. degree in Electrical Engineering from the National University of Sciences and Technology, Pakistan.</span>
</span></td></tr>
</table>
