<span id="tab6.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="tab6.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Liu Liu</span> 
is an Assistant Professor in the Department of Electrical, Computer, and Systems Engineering at Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute, Troy, NY, USA. His research interests include elastic AI computing systems and architecture design. He received the B.S. degree from the University of Electronic Science and Technology of China, the M.S. degree in electrical and computer engineering, and the Ph.D. degree in computer science, both from the University of California, Santa Barbara.</span>
</span></td></tr>
